{"ache":{"level":"caution","title":"A fairer gacha is still a gacha","note":"Nero compares pity systems, from Genshin’s 90-pull 50/50 to Endfield’s 120 hard pity and weapons folded into one banner. Spreading the risk differently is nicer, but it doesn’t remove it. His own line says it best: chasing dupes became about completing a system. Good on him for seeing it.","watch":["“fairer” pity still asking you to pull","a 0.6% base rate behind it all","completion turning into the goal"],"tip":"When a game says its gacha is fairer, read it as “less bad,” not “safe.” Your limit stays the same.","lines":["less risky isn’t no risk","pity is a number, not a kindness","he figured it out. I knew he would"]},"id":"0eb5e40f-600a-43f8-a832-2949f17c952a","title":"Changes in 2026 Gacha Explained","excerpt":"A personal analysis of modern gacha systems, from Genshin Impact to today.\nDo Arknights: Endfield’s guarantees and gear signal a real shift in design?","firstPublishedDate":"2025-12-20T23:45:06.009Z","lastPublishedDate":"2025-12-21T14:23:59.375Z","url":{"base":"https://www.tzero.live","path":"/post/gacha-changes-2026"},"slug":"gacha-changes-2026","categoryIds":["6fecd53b-e26c-46ca-a508-d8b36cda3c3b"],"tagIds":[],"memberId":"38ba494c-02f6-400e-9e2d-5cb850448e7a","minutesToRead":3,"media":{"embedMedia":{"thumbnail":{"url":"https://static.wixstatic.com/media/38ba49_4ca0a3ad67ff441e9905348b8e18e9a5~mv2.jpg","width":0,"height":0}},"displayed":true,"custom":true},"richContent":{"nodes":[{"type":"HEADING","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Arknights: Endfield and the First Real Shift in Gacha RPGs"}}],"style":{"paddingTop":"0px","paddingBottom":"10px"},"headingData":{"level":2,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO","lineHeight":"1.5"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"From "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"2021 onward","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":", in Italy, Europe, and North America—especially with and through "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Genshin Impact","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"—Chinese-origin gacha RPGs have taken on enormous weight within the gaming industry, influencing not only the market but also artistic and design choices."}}],"style":{"paddingTop":"0px","paddingBottom":"10px"},"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO","lineHeight":"1.5"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"In recent months, however, one title in particular has begun to spark discussion not so much for its aesthetics or setting, but for "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"how it treats the gacha system itself","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":": "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Arknights: Endfield","decorations":[{"type":"ITALIC","italicData":true}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"."}}],"style":{"paddingTop":"0px","paddingBottom":"10px"},"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO","lineHeight":"1.5"}}},{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"To understand why Endfield is interesting, it helps to take a step back and look at "}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"how current gacha models operate","decorations":[{"type":"BOLD","fontWeightValue":700}]}},{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":", placing them side by side."}}],"style":{"paddingTop":"0px","paddingBottom":"10px"},"paragraphData":{"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO","lineHeight":"1.5"}}},{"type":"HEADING","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Models Compared"}}],"style":{"paddingTop":"0px","paddingBottom":"10px"},"headingData":{"level":2,"textStyle":{"textAlignment":"AUTO","lineHeight":"1.5"}}},{"type":"TABLE","nodes":[{"type":"TABLE_ROW","nodes":[{"type":"TABLE_CELL","nodes":[{"type":"PARAGRAPH","nodes":[{"type":"TEXT","textData":{"text":"Game"}}],"style":{"paddingTop":"0px","paddingBottom":